.SH NAME
QXtWidget \- Allows mixing of Xt/Motif and Qt widgets [Qt Xt/Motif Extension]
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qxt.h>\fR
.PP
Inherits QWidget.
.PP
