Reimplemented for internal reasons; the API is not affected.
.PP
Reimplemented from QWidget.
.SH "void QXtWidget::resizeEvent ( QResizeEvent * ) \fC[virtual protected]\fR"
Reimplemented for internal reasons; the API is not affected.
.PP
Examples:
