mainlyQt/editor.cpp mainlyXt/editor.cpp
.)l
.PP
Reimplemented from QWidget.
.SH "Widget QXtWidget::xtWidget () const"
Returns the Xt widget equivalent for the Qt widget.
.PP
Examples:
.(l
mainlyXt/editor.cpp mainlyMotif/editor.cpp
.)l
